# Kron Project Conventions

Cursor-native companion to [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) and [architecture.md](../../docs/abstractDesign/architecture.md). Read all three before writing code. **architecture.md is the architectural source of truth**; this file and AGENTS.md are working-conventions mirrors.

## Tech stack (locked)

- Go 1.27 for core CLI (`cmd/kron/`, `internal/`)
- cobra for CLI parsing
- TOML for config (`BurntSushi/toml`)
- YAML for frontmatter (`gopkg.in/yaml.v3`)
- testify for test assertions
- MCP SDK: `github.com/modelcontextprotocol/go-sdk` (locked v1.2+)
- **v1.3+ pending — skeleton only (2026-10-09)**: `cmd/kron/serve-lsp/` stub created; LSP SDK (`go.lsp.dev/protocol v3.17+`) NOT yet added (still requires explicit approval per 铁律 #5); `frontend/` README placeholder created (real Wails code goes to a separate repo per 铁律 #9)
- **v1.3 main (RFC pending)**: GUI backend (Go Wails v2), GUI frontend (TypeScript + shadcn/ui in `frontend/`)
- **v1.4+ pending**: LSP SDK (`go.lsp.dev/protocol`), VSCode extension (副 GUI 路径, 复用 `kron serve-mcp` stdio)
- `ts-style` skill 已就位但 **v1 / v1.2 / v1.3 不启用** (没 .ts 代码)

## Repo layout

```
cmd/kron/                  ← thin CLI entry; dispatches to subcommands
├── main.go                ← wiring only; routes argv to cli / serve-mcp / serve-lsp
├── cli/                   ← stdlib flag command implementations (kron init / add / lint) — NO cobra
├── serve-mcp/             ← MCP stdio server (v1.2+ shipped)
├── serve-lsp/             ← LSP stdio server (v1.3+ stub 2026-10-09; package lsp, not implemented)
└── serve-gui/             ← (NEVER; GUI 是客户端层, 不进主仓 — architecture §0 铁律 #9)

internal/                  ← bottom-layer packages only, no access-layer code
├── model/                 ← domain types (Intent, Frontmatter, Config, Anchor, AnchorKind, IntentKind)
├── store/                 ← file I/O + MoveToTrash / RestoreFromTrash
├── parser/                ← markdown / anchor scan / slug / template
├── relations/             ← reverse-link graph (used by kron_impact / kron_delete)
├── lint/                  ← anchor-dangling + frontmatter + cycle + staleness
├── view/                  ← intent directory tree (v1.2+ BuildIntentTree / Flatten / Sort)
├── assumption/            ← .kron/assumptions/<id>.md B-3 independent file (v1.3)
└── identity/              ← created_by resolution

frontend/                  ← 客户端层占位 (Wails GUI) — README ONLY; 真实 Wails 项目在独立仓 (architecture §0 铁律 #9)

docs/                      ← design notes + RFC + process docs
  └── implementation/      ← 8 份 F 角色文档 2026-10-09 全部归档; 目录保留 README banner
.cursor/skills/            ← detailed style rules (auto-loaded)
.cursor/rules/             ← Cursor rule format (this file)
```

**Business logic goes in `internal/` (bottom layer) or in access-layer subcommands under `cmd/kron/<sub>/`. `internal/` MUST NOT import `cmd/kron/`. Access-layer subcommands MUST NOT import each other.**

## Architecture iron rules (don't violate)

Source: `docs/abstractDesign/architecture.md` §〇. Brief:

1. **Core decoupled from access layer** — `internal/store` / `parser` / `model` do not know whether the caller is CLI, MCP, or LSP.
2. **No cross-access-layer calls** — CLI / MCP / LSP three protocol access layers must not import or call each other; shared logic is sunk into `internal/`.
   > **(2026-10-08 变更)** 协议访问层**枚举**为 CLI / MCP / LSP 三种；IDE / GUI 是**客户端层**（外部），不直接 import `internal/`，只通过协议访问层**之一**调能力。
3. **Caller identity via `context.Context`** — every store/parser fn takes `ctx context.Context` first; access layer injects caller key.
   > **变更 (2026-10-08)**: caller 注入 API **不再推荐**。`model.WithCaller` / `CallerFrom` 等函数 **保留**（兼容既有 import + `cmd/kron/serve-mcp` 的 `callerInjectMiddleware`），但**新**访问层代码**不**再调用 `model.WithCaller`；`internal/` **不**依赖 ctx 上的 caller key 做行为分支。原因：`context.Context` 注入身份属性**不便于开发**（调试栈不直观 / 单元测试需额外包装 / 类型安全弱）。详见 [`internal/model/caller.go`](../../internal/model/caller.go) 头注释。`ctx` 仍保留在 store / parser 函数签名中**用于取消 / 超时传播**。
4. **One-way deps** — `cmd → cli → {parser, store} → model`; no cycles; `model` has zero external imports. `internal/**` never imports `cmd/kron/**`.
5. **CI lint is the only gate** — no runtime implicit state.
6. **CLI minimal subset** — only `init` / `add` / `lint` / `serve-mcp` / `serve-lsp` (v1.3+). `list` / `get` / `update` / `delete` / `restore` are MCP-only.

## Workflow

1. Read `docs/article.md` and `docs/requirements.md` before coding.
2. Read `docs/abstractDesign/architecture.md` before changing package boundaries or adding commands.
3. For a real-repo walkthrough of how Kron is used, see [`docs/how-it-works.md`](../../docs/how-it-works.md).
3. Verify the relevant skill (`go-style` or `ts-style`) is loaded.
4. Write tests for any new exported function in the same change.
5. Run before committing: `go vet ./...`, `gofmt -l .`, `go test ./...`.

## Off-limits without explicit human approval

- Adding new top-level dependencies (`go.mod` `require` block) — Wails / `go.lsp.dev/protocol` / shadcn 全部要走 explicit approval
- Modifying the Go version in `go.mod`
- Renaming or moving packages
- Reflection or `go generate` (must have a `// why` comment)
- Force-pushes, history rewrites on shared branches
- Changing the `.kron/intents/*.md` frontmatter schema
- Adding CLI subcommands beyond `init` / `add` / `lint` / `serve-mcp` — and **v1.3+** `serve-lsp` / `serve-gui` 必走 [`docs/process/new-access-layer.md`](../../docs/process/new-access-layer.md)（待写）
- Adding `config.toml` fields beyond `intents_dir`
- Implementing `serve-lsp`, `serve-gui` (v1.3+ pending), IDE plugin, hard-delete / GC — 全部走 `docs/process/new-access-layer.md` 流程

## Skills (auto-loaded per language)

- `go-style` → see [SKILL.md](../skills/go-style/SKILL.md) — **当前唯一生效** (v1 / v1.2 仓库仅 Go 代码)
- `ts-style` → see [SKILL.md](../skills/ts-style/SKILL.md) — **v1.3+ 启用** (frontend/ 目录出现后)

